# Moderation steps go to QA

The agent has no access to the moderation portal. Do not open it and do not act as a moderator. Stop before a step in that portal and ask QA to perform it. That step stays unperformed until QA has done it.

The author's actions «Опубликовать», «Отправить на публикацию», and «Отправить на проверку» are not the moderation portal. Perform them when the check includes them.

If it is unclear whether the next step is in the moderation portal, do not take it and ask QA. Do not invent the steps.

Continue the scenario from what QA reports and from behavior that is visible on the environment under test.
